research/datasets/**
!research/datasets/**/
!research/datasets/**/manifest.json
!research/datasets/acoding/ACcoding.zip
research/results/
research/kt-bench/.venv/
research/kt-bench/.work/
research/kt-bench/data/
research/kt-bench/folds/*_sequences.csv
research/external/open-notebook/

